  "item": [
    {
      "id": "78e76650-95cb-4ad9-ae99-1fcf9051e5e8",
      "name": "Accounts",
      "description": {
        "content": "### What is it?\n\nRepresents AWeber Customer Accounts that have authorized your application.\n\nThe Account collection contains a single account entry for the AWeber Customer Account\nthat has authorized your application.  You can use the links in the Account entry to\nretrieve the lists owned by the account as well as the social integrations associated\nwith the account.\n\n### Related endpoints\n\n* [Accounts](#tag/Accounts)\n\n### Related code samples\n\n* [Find a list on an account](#tag/Find-a-List-and-Get-Tags)\n* [Get Integrations List](#tag/Get-Integrations-List)\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "a2bde367-1e7f-4858-aef4-9b0f0927abb4",
          "name": "Get accounts",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get accounts",
            "description": {
              "content": "This endpoint is used to get a paginated collection of accounts.\n\nCheck out examples for <a href=\"https://github.com/aweber/public-api-examples/tree/master/python\" target=\"_blank\">Python</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/aweber/public-api-examples/tree/master/php\" target=\"_blank\">PHP</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/aweber/public-api-examples/tree/master/postman\" target=\"_blank\">Postman</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/aweber/public-api-examples/tree/master/csharp\" target=\"_blank\">C#.NET</a>,\n<a href=\"https://github.com/aweber/public-api-examples/tree/master/ruby\" target=\"_blank\">Ruby</a>,\nand <a href=\"https://github.com/aweber/public-api-examples/blob/master/node\" target=\"_blank\">Node.js</a>.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "accounts"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "ws.start",
                  "value": "0",
                  "description": "The pagination starting offset"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "ws.size",
                  "value": "100",
                  "description": "The pagination total entries to retrieve"
                }
              ],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": {
              "type": "oauth2",
              "oauth2": [
                {
                  "key": "scope",
                  "value": "account.read landing-page.read list.read list.write subscriber.read subscriber.write subscriber.read-extended email.read email.write"
                },
                {
                  "key": "redirect_uri",
                  "value": "https://auth.aweber.com/oauth2/token"
                },
                {
                  "key": "accessTokenUrl",
                  "value": "https://auth.aweber.com/oauth2/token"
                },
                {
                  "key": "authUrl",
                  "value": "https://auth.aweber.com/oauth2/authorize"
                },
                {
                  "key": "grant_type",
                  "value": "authorization_code"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
